# Channel gives the player a mana ability of their own (CR 611.2a, 605.1a), not the card: it lasts until end of turn
# whatever becomes of Channel. Bot1 casts Channel, then Timetwister paying {2} with that ability, and Timetwister
# shuffles Channel from the graveyard into the library. The ability is still offered - with no card as its source,
# since the card is now hidden - and taken once more, and the game hands over at Bot1's priority with it still offered.

